  "description": "An A-list star has a crush on a rookie idol.\n\nJung-Woo 'Lucifer' Lee, a member of the obscure idol group Sweet Devils, dreams of making it big. His one claim to fame — an accidental pants-ripping on air — leads to a chance encounter with A-list star Kwon-Jun Kang. Turns out, Kwon-Jun has been harboring an intense crush on Lucifer. What will happen when an unexpected one-night stand leads to an ambiguous romance? How will this A-list star and D-list idol navigate their relationship? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
